# Douglas Peucker Algorithm

This project implements the Douglas-Peucker line simplification algorithm.

The algorithm reduces the number of points in a line according to the epsilon value.

- Small epsilon keeps more detail.
- Large epsilon simplifies the line more.

## Run

```bash
py main.py
